D-Shell Help

Commands:
  cat <file name>,
    Displays the contents of a text file
  cd <directory to cd into>,
    Changes the current working directory of the shell
  clear,
    Clears the screen,
  echo "[text]",
    Outputs the text in the input
  edit [file name],
    A built in text editor to edit your text files
  exit,
    Exits the shell

Usage policy not implemented yet.
